（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Button"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Toggle"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Slider"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 等等）\n每新写一个面板逻辑，都会为这些控件做一些相同的事情，比如：声明控件、查找控件、监听控件等等\n请问：我们应该如何提升我们的开发效率，让这些事情不用每次都去做？（至少说出两种方案）"}]},{"ID":"20250424155659-gujg722","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20250424155659-gujg722","updated":"20250424155704"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250424155704-vmjj6sq","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250424155704-vmjj6sq","updated":"20250424155704"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250424155704-dfgzg4v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250424155704-dfgzg4v","updated":"20250424155706"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"方案一：制作自动生成代码的工具，将声明控件、查找控件、监听控件这些事情自动生成"}]}]},{"ID":"20250424155707-6btk0kn","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250424155707-6btk0kn","updated":"20250424155707"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250424155707-m0bvzbc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250424155707-m0bvzbc","updated":"20250424155707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"方案二：创建面板基类，在基类中进行统一处理，新面板只需继承该基类，基类代码就可以帮助我们完成声明控件、查找控件、监听控件这些事情"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250424153802-krs83hq","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20250424153802-krs83hq","updated":"20250424153802"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250424153802-pq6xbc7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250424153802-pq6xbc7","updated":"20250424155823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20240514221515-bvz79nv","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"正交矩阵"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 的基本概念是什么？它对我们来说有什么意义？"}]},{"ID":"20250424155828-ogcysfo","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20250424155828-ogcysfo","updated":"20250424155842"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250424155842-bgzmbv2","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250424155842-bgzmbv2","updated":"20250424155842"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250424155842-rykzos8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250424155842-rykzos8","updated":"20250424155842"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"基本概念：正交矩阵是一种特殊的方阵\n一个方阵和它的转置矩阵相乘为单位矩阵，那么它就是正交矩阵\n如果一个矩阵是正交矩阵，那么它的转置矩阵也是正交矩阵"}]}]},{"ID":"20250424155843-hivj5pg","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250424155843-hivj5pg","updated":"20250424155843"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250424155843-320nkj2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250424155843-320nkj2","updated":"20250424155848"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对我们的意义： 如果一个矩阵是正交的，那么它的逆矩阵等于其转置矩阵，可以非常方便的进行逆运算，用于取消之前的变换"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250424153802-pqps3bt","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NS4=","Num":5},"Properties":{"id":"20250424153802-pqps3bt","updated":"20250424160021"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250424153802-wnc2fcc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250424153802-wnc2fcc","updated":"20250424155921"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Shader 和材质球的关系是什么？"}]},{"ID":"20250424155922-i7p8rrd","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250424155922-i7p8rrd","updated":"20250424155924"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250424155924-m28sgqu","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250424155924-m28sgqu","updated":"20250424155924"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250424155924-4q0tmb7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250424155924-4q0tmb7","updated":"20250424155933"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一个 Shader 可以与无数个材质关联。"}]}]},{"ID":"20250424155929-arxfsvv","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250424155929-arxfsvv","updated":"20250424155929"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250424155929-nkcpk4d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250424155929-nkcpk4d","updated":"20250424155935"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一个材质同一时刻只能关联于一个 Shader。（为什么说是同一时刻，因为我们可以通过代码去动态改变材质所关联的Shader）"}]}]},{"ID":"20250424155939-qiscrob","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20250424155939-qiscrob","updated":"20250424155939"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250424155939-0pn1ufs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250424155939-0pn1ufs","updated":"20250424155943"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"材质可以赋与模型，但是 Shader 不行。"}]}]},{"ID":"20250424155945-zr9wgww","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20250424155945-zr9wgww","updated":"20250424155945"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250424155945-c17hp41","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250424155945-c17hp41","updated":"20250424155952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"材质就像是 Shader 的实例，每个材质都可以参数不一样呈现不同的效果，但是当 Shader 改变时，关联它的所有材质都会相应的改变。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250424155954-iss2su4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250424155954-iss2su4","updated":"20250424160021"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"举个例子：比如游戏中的怪物，我们只需做一个 Shader，然后每个怪物给它一个材质球，材质球上赋与不同的贴图与参数来表现不同的怪物。"}]}]}]}]}